    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sled Together is just a cozy place to spend some time with your friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/dbaee7e5a22b04e0338eb261d15e4e21.poster.avif?t=1739208182\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/dbaee7e5a22b04e0338eb261d15e4e21.webm?t=1739208182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/dbaee7e5a22b04e0338eb261d15e4e21.mp4?t=1739208182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<br>SLED SLED SLED!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your sled and enjoy sledding down the hill. There are a lot of hills to try out, choose any of them and don\u2019t think about anything but sledding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/eb85410fee8dafdc47f6cc46d408ce41.poster.avif?t=1739208182\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/eb85410fee8dafdc47f6cc46d408ce41.webm?t=1739208182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/eb85410fee8dafdc47f6cc46d408ce41.mp4?t=1739208182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character (you are a penguin(your friends are too)):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scarves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sun glasses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And other warm things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/7eb236b4435c9b0708b897ac077fdaaa.poster.avif?t=1739208182\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/7eb236b4435c9b0708b897ac077fdaaa.webm?t=1739208182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/7eb236b4435c9b0708b897ac077fdaaa.mp4?t=1739208182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your own base, but remember that penguins perceive ice floes as beaches. This place is supposed to look like a sunny-sandy resort, but for penguins!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/9f0b249e8340bd54db9254e19ea71248.poster.avif?t=1739208182\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/9f0b249e8340bd54db9254e19ea71248.webm?t=1739208182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/9f0b249e8340bd54db9254e19ea71248.mp4?t=1739208182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Chat with your friends and random people (they will become your friends later)! Play snowballs, make snowmen and snow angels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/7b02cb77c069427e3040a7ea946a11af.poster.avif?t=1739208182\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/7b02cb77c069427e3040a7ea946a11af.webm?t=1739208182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477230/extras/7b02cb77c069427e3040a7ea946a11af.mp4?t=1739208182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Last but not least - HOT CHOCOLATE TIME! Tired of sledding and just want to relax and watch others having fun? Get yourself a tasty hot drink and enjoy your being</p>",
